/**
 * \class event_template
 * \brief Provides the schema for parsing and importing events from ROOT trees.
 *
 * `event_template` acts as a blueprint. The underlying C++ backend uses it to read ROOT trees and dynamically build event representations in memory.
 * It stores critical structural mapping data such as `Trees`, `Branches`, `leaves`, `index`, and `weight`.
 *
 * \fn bool event_template::operator==(const event_template& p)
 * \brief Equality operator for robust identification of events.
 *
 * \fn std::string event_template::hash()
 * \brief Hashing function to generate a unique identifier for the event.
 */
